      "text": "Heavily bidding the dips on kinetiq:native and ethereum:0xb1d1eae60eea9525032a6dcb4c1ce336a1de71be here.\n\nThink whether we get Sideways or Shakeout September, it'll be Opulent October once we have @Kinetiq_xyz Elysium live and the @DeriveXYZ v3 update. \n\nCrypto participants have such short term memory and time horizons that almost all big update announcements get pump and dumped unless there's instant gratification.\n\nI think both are similar in that they're around ~$200m FDV, have large rerating events coming up that the market seemingly brushed off, and have reasonable liquid 5-10x potential.",
