      "text": "The same people who are criticizing @HyperliquidX buying and burning 40bps of hyperliquid:native mcap per month as \"wasteful\" or \"useless\" are going to try and convince you that bitcoin:native decreasing inflation by 40bps per YEAR in 2028 will lead to a raging bull market.\n\nhyperliquid:native buybacks are an order of magnitude more impactful than bitcoin:native halvings. Strictly on supply and demand, hard to believe in one and not the other.\n\nAlso impossible to disentangle what the buybacks have already done for hyperliquid:native price and alignment with @HyperliquidX current success. The strong PA of hyperliquid:native has likely captured more attention and onboarded more users than $1b of direct marketing or growth budget ever could have.",
